{"Title":"An Act relative to Chapter 32 of the Massachusetts General Laws","BillNumber":"H2464","DocketNumber":"HD2020","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"T_C1","Name":"Tackey Chan","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/T_C1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-18T16:20:23.603"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"T_C1","Name":"Tackey Chan","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/T_C1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-18T16:20:23.6033333"},{"Id":null,"Name":"David Holway","Type":3,"Details":null,"ResponseDate":"2023-01-18T16:20:23.6333333"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H2464/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Chan of Quincy, a petition (accompanied by bill, House, No. 2464) of Tackey Chan and David Holway relative to employees of the Massachusetts Water Resources Authority under the retirement law for public employees.  Public Service.","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. The definition of “Regular Compensation” as defined in section 1 of chapter 32 of the General Laws is hereby amended by inserting after the word “firefighters,” in line 453, the following:- “employees of the Massachusetts Water Resources Authority.”\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Accompanied","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J23","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J23"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}